# 1. SYSTEM IDENTITY

AI-Investor is a:

> AI-native financial dashboard AND Staff-level QA Engineering reference system

It is NOT a production trading system.

It is a **portfolio-grade engineering demonstration platform** designed to showcase:

- Staff+ SDET engineering capability
- AI-assisted software engineering discipline
- modern full-stack architecture design
- scalable test automation systems
- AI governance and agent design

---

# 2. PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

The goal of this project is to demonstrate:

> “How a Staff/Principal SDET builds, governs, and scales a modern AI-assisted engineering system.”

This includes:

- architecture design
- test strategy design
- API and service abstraction
- AI integration patterns
- CI/CD readiness
- documentation discipline

---

# 3. TARGET AUDIENCE

This project is designed for:

- Staff SDET interviewers
- Principal QA / QA Architect hiring managers
- Senior engineering leaders
- AI engineering recruiters
- platform engineering teams

NOT end users.

The UI is secondary to engineering signal.

---

# 4. CORE ENGINEERING PRINCIPLES

The system must always prioritize:

## 4.1 Correctness over speed
No feature is complete without validation and tests.

## 4.2 Architecture over convenience
Shortcuts that violate structure are not allowed.

## 4.3 Clarity over complexity
Simple systems with clear boundaries are preferred over clever designs.

## 4.4 Observability over assumption
All system behavior must be explainable and traceable.

---

# 5. SYSTEM SCOPE

## IN SCOPE

- Stock dashboard UI (Next.js)
- Service-layer architecture
- API abstraction layer
- Yahoo Finance integration (via providers)
- Playwright test automation framework
- AI-assisted engineering workflows
- CI/CD pipelines
- documentation system
- AI agents (test generation, analysis, etc.)

---

## OUT OF SCOPE

- Real-money trading systems
- Financial advice systems
- High-frequency trading systems
- Production brokerage integrations
- End-user financial compliance systems

---

# 6. ARCHITECTURAL PHILOSOPHY

The system follows:

> Layered modular architecture with strict separation of concerns

Core rule:

- UI is NOT business logic
- Services define system behavior
- Providers handle external dependencies
- AI assists but does not decide

---

# 7. QUALITY BAR (STAFF+ STANDARD)

Every feature must demonstrate:

- scalable system thinking
- production-grade test coverage strategy
- clean abstraction design
- AI governance awareness
- maintainable architecture

---

# 8. AI USAGE PHILOSOPHY

AI is treated as:

> A constrained engineering assistant, not an autonomous actor

AI must:

- follow architectural rules
- respect service boundaries
- produce verifiable outputs
- be validated through testing and review

AI must NOT:

- introduce unchecked logic
- bypass architecture layers
- directly modify system state

---

# 9. PORTFOLIO STRATEGY

This project is designed to:

- maximize interview signal density
- demonstrate Staff+ engineering thinking
- showcase AI engineering maturity
- provide structured storytelling in interviews

Every feature must contribute to:

> “Why this candidate is Staff/Principal ready”

